{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-01-20 10:29:00', 'title': 'TOP ENERGY TRANSITION TRENDS TO WATCH IN 2022: S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ANALYTICS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ANALYSTS AT S&P GLOBAL PLATTS, THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION, ANALYSIS AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THEIR TOP ENERGY TRANSITION TRENDS TO WATCH IN 2022, NOTING THAT KEY DEVELOPMENTS THIS YEAR WILL PROVIDE INSIGHT INTO THE MOMENTUM OF THE ENERGY TRANSITION AND THE DEGREE OF PUBLIC SUPPORT. ANNE ROBBA, MANAGER OF FUTURE ENERGY SIGNPOSTS, S&P GLOBAL PLATTS, SAID : "WE\'LL BE WATCHING CLOSELY TO SEE IF THE PUBLIC STILL HAS A STRONG APPETITE TO \'GO ELECTRIC\' IN TRANSPORTATION IN 2022.'}